### Library Management System - HTTP Scratch File
### Credentials: admin / admin
### App runs on: http://localhost:8080

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088
@authHeader = Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Show login page
GET {{baseUrl}}/userlogin

###

### Login (form-based)
POST {{baseUrl}}/userlogin
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin

###

### Home page
GET {{baseUrl}}/home
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### About page
GET {{baseUrl}}/about
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Contact Us page
GET {{baseUrl}}/contactus
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# BOOKS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/show-listof-all-books
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Show add-book form
GET {{baseUrl}}/add-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Add a book (POST form)
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

book_name=Clean+Code&book_authors=Robert+C.+Martin&book_price=39.99&book_dept=Computer+Science&book_published=2008-08-01&is_book_available=true

###

### Delete a book by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-book?id=1
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Show edit-book form
GET {{baseUrl}}/edit-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Edit a book name by ID (POST form)
POST {{baseUrl}}/edit-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1&bookname=Clean+Code+2nd+Edition

###

### Show book details search page
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-book-details
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Get details for a specific book
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-book-details-one?book_name=Clean+Code
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Get book details for a non-existent book (expect error/empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-book-details-one?book_name=NonExistentBook
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Show book tracking details page
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-book-tracking-details
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# MEMBERS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all members
GET {{baseUrl}}/show-listof-all-members
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Show add-member form
GET {{baseUrl}}/add-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Add a member (POST form)
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

member_name=John+Doe&member_address=123+Main+St&member_phone_number=9876543210&member_dept=Computer+Science&member_gender=male&member_age=25

###

### Delete a member by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-member?id=1
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Show edit-member form
GET {{baseUrl}}/edit-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Edit a member (POST form)
POST {{baseUrl}}/edit-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1&membername=Jane+Doe&memberaddress=456+Elm+St&membergender=female&memberage=28

###

### Show member details search page
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-member-details
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Get details for a specific member
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-member-details-one?member_name=John+Doe
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Get details for a non-existent member (expect error/null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-member-details-one?member_name=NonExistentMember
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Show member tracking details page
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-member-tracking-details
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# BORROW / SMART BOOK SYSTEM
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Show borrow page (lists members and books)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sml-main
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Borrow books for a member (POST form — up to 3 books)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sml-main
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

memberName=John+Doe&bookName=Clean+Code&bookName2=&bookName3=

###

### Show borrow list
GET {{baseUrl}}/show-barrow-list
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Set return date for a member
GET {{baseUrl}}/set-returndate?member=John+Doe
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Return a book (delete from borrow list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/del-smartbs?name=John+Doe
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### Show total borrow history
GET {{baseUrl}}/show-total-history
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# EDGE CASES & VALIDATION PROBES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Books: type mismatch on id (int expected, string given) ---
# Expected: 400 / exception page
### delete-book: id is a string instead of int
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-book?id=abc
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### edit-book: id is a string instead of int
POST {{baseUrl}}/edit-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=abc&bookname=ValidName

###

### add-book: price is a string instead of double
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

book_name=TestBook&book_authors=Author&book_price=notANumber&book_dept=CSE&book_published=2024-01-01&is_book_available=true


# --- Books: missing required parameters ---
# Expected: 400 MissingServletRequestParameterException
### delete-book: id param is missing entirely
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### get-book-details-one: book_name param is missing entirely
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-book-details-one
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### edit-book POST: bookname param is missing
POST {{baseUrl}}/edit-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1


# --- Books: boundary / semantic edge cases ---
# Expected: silent no-op or unvalidated data accepted (reveals missing validation)
### delete-book: negative id — no validation, silently ignored
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-book?id=-1
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### delete-book: id that does not exist — no validation, silently ignored
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-book?id=99999
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### edit-book: empty bookname — sets name to empty string with no error
POST {{baseUrl}}/edit-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1&bookname=

###

### add-book: negative price — no validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

book_name=NegativePriceBook&book_authors=Author&book_price=-99.99&book_dept=CSE&book_published=2024-01-01&is_book_available=true

###

### add-book: all fields empty / blank — reveals lack of @NotBlank validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

book_name=&book_authors=&book_price=&book_dept=&book_published=&is_book_available=

###

### add-book: extremely long book_name — reveals lack of @Size validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-book
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

book_name=AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA&book_authors=Author&book_price=10.0&book_dept=CSE&book_published=2024-01-01&is_book_available=true

###

# Bug: BookController always puts the error message in the model regardless of
# whether the book was found (unlike MemberController which checks for null).
# Even a valid book name will show "No Subjects are available".
### get-book-details-one: existing book — error message shown anyway (bug)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-book-details-one?book_name=C
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### get-book-details-one: empty book_name — NullPointerException risk in equalsIgnoreCase
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-book-details-one?book_name=
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


# --- Members: type mismatch ---
### delete-member: id is a string
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-member?id=abc
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### edit-member: memberage is a string
POST {{baseUrl}}/edit-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1&membername=Jane&memberaddress=123+St&membergender=female&memberage=notAnInt


# --- Members: missing required parameters ---
### delete-member: id param is missing entirely
GET {{baseUrl}}/delete-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### get-member-details-one: member_name param is missing entirely
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-member-details-one
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### edit-member POST: memberage param is missing
POST {{baseUrl}}/edit-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1&membername=Jane&memberaddress=123+St&membergender=female


# --- Members: boundary / semantic edge cases ---
### add-member: negative age — no validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

member_name=NegAge&member_address=Somewhere&member_phone_number=9876543210&member_dept=CSE&member_gender=male&member_age=-5

###

### add-member: phone number overflows long (too many digits)
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

member_name=OverflowPhone&member_address=Somewhere&member_phone_number=99999999999999999999&member_dept=CSE&member_gender=male&member_age=20

###

### add-member: all fields empty — reveals lack of @NotBlank validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-member
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

member_name=&member_address=&member_phone_number=&member_dept=&member_gender=&member_age=

###

### get-member-details-one: empty member_name — NullPointerException risk
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-member-details-one?member_name=
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


# --- Borrow system: missing required @RequestParam values ---
# bookName2 and bookName3 have no default/required=false — missing them throws
### sml-main POST: bookName2 and bookName3 missing
POST {{baseUrl}}/sml-main
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

memberName=Name+A&bookName=C

###

### sml-main POST: memberName missing entirely
POST {{baseUrl}}/sml-main
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

bookName=C&bookName2=&bookName3=

###

### set-returndate: member param missing entirely
GET {{baseUrl}}/set-returndate
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### del-smartbs: name param missing entirely
GET {{baseUrl}}/del-smartbs
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

# --- Borrow system: semantic edge cases ---
### sml-main POST: borrow same book three times — no duplicate check
POST {{baseUrl}}/sml-main
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

memberName=Name+A&bookName=C&bookName2=C&bookName3=C

###

### sml-main POST: borrow with an unknown member name — no validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/sml-main
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

memberName=GhostMember&bookName=C&bookName2=&bookName3=

###

### del-smartbs: name that is not in the borrow list — silent no-op
GET {{baseUrl}}/del-smartbs?name=GhostMember
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### set-returndate: member not in borrow list — returns null silently
GET {{baseUrl}}/set-returndate?member=GhostMember
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


# --- Unauthenticated access ---
# Expected: redirect to /userlogin (302)
### Access protected page without credentials
GET {{baseUrl}}/show-listof-all-books
